    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a fur trading empire</strong> in the rich, historical world of 18th-century North America<strong>.</strong> Start with a single, modest cabin and strategically expand your influence to <strong>amass a fortune</strong>. Your ambition is the only limit on the wild frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR NATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your enterprise as Canada, France, Great Britain, Netherlands, Russia, Spain, Sweden, or the United States\u2014each with <strong>unique strengths</strong>, <strong>historical advantages</strong>, and <strong>strategic challenges</strong>. Or, for a truly balanced experience, play as the neutral nation of Beaverland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FORGE ALLIANCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The land is home to hundreds of tribal nations. Your reputation is your <strong>most valuable asset</strong>, defined through key decisions. Supplying a tribe with weapons will strengthen your standing, while dealing in alcohol or arming their enemies will damage it. A high reputation increases the volume of goods a tribe will offer, while a poor reputation can see you shut out of their territory entirely, or even <strong>go to war</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A LIVING ECOSYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade in a world with a dynamic ecosystem based on historical migration patterns. Your choices have lasting consequences, forcing you to expand and adapt to an ever-changing landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A UNIQUE TRADING EXPERIENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Made Beaver</i> is a unique blend of <strong>deep economic strategy </strong>and <strong>rich historical simulation</strong>. While your goal is profit, your path is paved with history. Crafted by a solo developer committed to historical accuracy, every detail\u2014from trade routes and prices, to furs, tribes, and settlements\u2014is designed to create an authentic and challenging experience that <strong>you won't find in any other trading game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to carve your name into history? <strong>Launch your trading empire today</strong> and become the master of the fur trade!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a fur trading empire</strong> in the rich, historical world of 18th-century North America<strong>.</strong> Start with a single, modest cabin and strategically expand your influence to <strong>amass a fortune</strong>. Your ambition is the only limit on the wild frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR NATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your enterprise as Canada, France, Great Britain, Netherlands, Russia, Spain, Sweden, or the United States\u2014each with <strong>unique strengths</strong>, <strong>historical advantages</strong>, and <strong>strategic challenges</strong>. Or, for a truly balanced experience, play as the neutral nation of Beaverland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FORGE ALLIANCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The land is home to hundreds of tribal nations. Your reputation is your <strong>most valuable asset</strong>, defined through key decisions. Supplying a tribe with weapons will strengthen your standing, while dealing in alcohol or arming their enemies will damage it. A high reputation increases the volume of goods a tribe will offer, while a poor reputation can see you shut out of their territory entirely, or even <strong>go to war</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A LIVING ECOSYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade in a world with a dynamic ecosystem based on historical migration patterns. Your choices have lasting consequences, forcing you to expand and adapt to an ever-changing landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A UNIQUE TRADING EXPERIENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Made Beaver</i> is a unique blend of <strong>deep economic strategy </strong>and <strong>rich historical simulation</strong>. While your goal is profit, your path is paved with history. Crafted by a solo developer committed to historical accuracy, every detail\u2014from trade routes and prices, to furs, tribes, and settlements\u2014is designed to create an authentic and challenging experience that <strong>you won't find in any other trading game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to carve your name into history? <strong>Launch your trading empire today</strong> and become the master of the fur trade!</p>",
